					' * Reads object from stream. Reads all filesystems. Persistent and system file systems are untouched; all others are removed and possibly reread.
					' * @param oos object output stream
					' * @exception IOException if an error occures
					' * @exception ClassNotFoundException if read class is not found
					' */
					readExternal(ois : Netbeans_v1.0.x.java.io.ObjectInput)
					'/** 
